Bind Npc 31568 Zone 11 for karus
Bind Npc 31567 Zone 12 for elmorad
Quest 777 "[Lemegeton] Lemegeton, Scroll which sealed Devil 72"
    Journal for karus "You must deliver [Lemegeton] to the [Leader of Order of the Sorcery] Malraseu."
    Journal for elmorad "You must deliver [Lemegeton] to the [Leader of Order of the Sorcery] Pelore."
    Collect 1 of 900296000

Requires (player level >= 75 and player is karus and quest 775 is completed) or (player level >= 75 and player is elmorad and quest 776 is completed)

Rewards
    Give 250000 experience
    Give 30000 coins

On available
    Say "Master, everything seems to be almost done. At last, let's bring this book to Malraseus."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "I knew you would come around this time."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "The Demon War will soon be over. The remaining remnants are being pursued by our [Order of the Sorcery]\n\nWe must deliver [Lemegeton] to Malraseu the [Order of the Sorcery Leade] of Eslant."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "I knew you would come around this time."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "The Demon War will soon be over. The remaining remnants are being pursued by our [Order of the Sorcery]\n\nWe must deliver [Lemegeton] to Pelore the [Order of the Sorcery Leade] of Eslant."

On in_progress
    Say "Where did you forget it? Check it again."

On claimable
    Show quest "Good job. This [Devil72 Seal Lemegeton] will be on the bottom of the lake forever.\n\nThis has been a long journey. What you have done will be told and retold. Hope you can help for our next war."
